# The brief as game experience (arena --brief experience, WITHIN_REASON_BRIEF=experience); the commander reads it whole.
# One document path a line, in reading order; `#` lines and blank lines are ignored. Assembled by the bot at every
# session start (crates/bot/src/texts.rs `assemble`), every HTML comment and every deprecated passage stripped;
# nothing assembled is committed (docs/design/2026-10-21-brief-rework.md §4). The hand-written documents are under
# docs/briefs/experience/; the generated ones under docs/briefs/reference/ are written by their generators
# (run/reference_set.py, run/timelines.py, run/opponent_set.py, run/frontier_set.py --brief, run/map_sheets.py).
